; The fix is offered for the ENTRY file only. `leak` lives in
; mods/EffLeak.ax and performs IO undeclared: its AX3042 renders
; against that file and carries the two prose helps and no `~>`. `main`
; here calls it and is undeclared too, and ITS line carries the fix -
; the same code, the same message, one with an edit and one without,
; decided by which file the span indexes.
(import EffLeak (leak))

(:: main Int)
(fn (main) (leak 1))
